<title>JAPAN: Kawaguchi Chemical -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kawaguchi Chemical -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to May 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.15		vs	    4.12</p>
<p> Operating	  123    million	  vs	  144    million</p>
<p> Current	    102    million	  vs	  109    million</p>
<p> Net		   55    million	  vs	   99    million</p>
<p> EPS		    4.58 yen	  vs	    8.19 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     12 million	  vs	  12 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Kawaguchi Chemical Industry Co Ltd is a major manufacturer of rubber chemicals.</p>
